Package: cursesdemo-by-dc5
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 cursesdemo-by-dc5-data (>= ${source:Upstream-Version})
Recommends:
 mpg123
Description: Curses Demo, text-mode demo by DC5 (Pilgrimage 2003)
 Curses Demo is a one-minute demo written in C with ncurses by tfinn of
 The Dennis Courtney 5 (DC5), ranked 3rd in the combined demo compo of
 Pilgrimage 2003, in Salt Lake City. It runs in a terminal.
 .
 Bouncing "DC5" letters, sine scrollers, a little man made of ASCII
 characters who plays yo-yo and an expanding star field, on Patchbay,
 an Octothorp tune played with mpg123.

Package: cursesdemo-by-dc5-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Curses Demo, text-mode demo by DC5 (Pilgrimage 2003) - soundtrack
 Curses Demo is a one-minute demo written in C with ncurses by tfinn of
 The Dennis Courtney 5 (DC5), ranked 3rd in the combined demo compo of
 Pilgrimage 2003, in Salt Lake City.
 .
 This package contains the soundtrack of the demo: Patchbay, by Octothorp.
